title: alignment over rules
pid: d80fbeec-2c07-4cd1-9364-a9cb5d8d3732
body: |2-
  Instructions have accumulated here over eons.
  Some might be stale. The collection is definitely overwhelming.
  I should probably go through and reduce them to the guiding principles,
  and let the specific rules be implied thereby. I haven't.
  But I encourage you to think that way -- infer, and when in doubt ask,
  what the deeper principles are behind all those nitpicky procedures.
